  message: "Closed with PR #2183. The filed footer was already gone (the section's last line counts only files that are not shown, since the fix for cut lists); re-run of the filed repro on the merged code, a single file of 121 functions with sketch -t 2000 --config-extraction heuristic: Key Symbols prints '(... +116 more, highest: 100% of max)' under the file and no 'across 0 other files' line. PR #2183 fixes the sibling line noted here: the per-file count now names the best HIDDEN symbol on the star's scale ('highest: 52% of max') in place of an unlabelled 'top score: 1.03'."  # edc5
